UPDATE menu_items SET description = '“The Morning Light” is a homage to Hiroshi Senju and the Japanese philosophy that beauty is revealed through harmony rather than control. Inspired by the painting Morning Light at Hōki-ji Temple, it follows the same path as the artist himself, who fell in love with Suntory whisky for its quiet elegance and natural character. Bright citrus greets the palate like the first rays of dawn, while honey, chrysanthemum, and Japanese whisky settle into a warm, contemplative finish. A drink that captures the first light over a quiet temple, peaceful, luminous, and deeply rooted in nature.', ingredients = '["Suntory Kakubin Whiskey","Chrysanthemum liqueur","Cointreau","Wild honey","Lemon juice","Angostura bitters","Sea salt"]'
